# Recipe: Search with Suggestions

Coming soon — this recipe walks a search field with async suggestions:
AutoSuggestBox driven by a debounced async source, keyboard navigation
of the suggestion list, history persistence. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Forms](../forms.md) and
[Async Resources](../async-resources.md) cover the underlying primitives.
